          "title": "Quest 1: Battle for the Hill",
          "briefing": "Enter the Capitol halls in Midterm Elections: Battle for the Hill. Storm the Briefing Room, Committee Chamber, War Room, and Oval Office—defeat the partisan bosses and the three Hydra Bosses (Talarixon, El-Rogers, and Brownsted), expose the bipartisan slush fund, and reach the Capitol exit stairs!",
