      "robos:archetype": "Ohio Hydra",
      "robos:specialAbility": "Union Strike (3 dice to all adjacent heroes) • Budget Freeze (no hero potions for 1 round) • Bipartisan Gridlock (roll combat die each turn: black shield = lose turn, skull = +1 atk die) • Political Infighting (≤4 BP: white shield lets heroes pick special attack)",
      "robos:abilities": "Union Strike: Attack every adjacent hero with 3 dice. | Budget Freeze: Prevent heroes using potions for one round. | Bipartisan Gridlock: Roll combat die each turn. Black shield = lose turn; skull = +1 attack die. | Political Infighting: At ≤4 BP, roll a combat die at start of turn; on a white shield, heroes choose which available special attack it uses.",
      "dcterms:description": "Brown + Husted · Ohio Hydra Boss — Union Strike: Attack every adjacent hero with 3 dice. Budget Freeze: Prevent heroes using potions for one round. Bipartisan Gridlock: Roll combat die each turn. Black shield = lose turn; skull = +1 attack die. Universal Hydra Rule — Political Infighting: At ≤4 BP, on a white shield at turn start, heroes choose its special attack.",
